 ## How it works
-The algorithm operates on a preprocessed representation of the volume where the colon shape is approximated by a sequence of piecewise boxes. It determines visibility by projecting these boxes onto the screen and maintaining an Aggregate Cull Window (ACW) that represents the visible portion of the screen through which subsequent boxes can be seen.
